        <p>
          Your Android phone, see instructions at, see instructions at <url href="https://bit.ly/2XAY6dQ"> https://bit.ly/2XAY6dQ</url>  
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul> 

    
 
</li>
<li><title>Desmos</title>
<p>
  The primary calculator tool that we will use is Desmos <url href="https://www.desmos.com/ "> https://www.desmos.com/ </url> This is a free web-based tool that can run in any browser, or on your smartphone\tablet as an app. Once you are in Desmos, you can login with your Google account in order to save and share your work. 
</p>
      </li>

      <li><title>Amplify Classroom: </title>
<p>
  Many of our in-class activities will be done on our Amplify Classroom platform. Join our classroom at <url href="https://learning.amplify.com/join/#/ZEAJ62 "> https://learning.amplify.com/join/#/ZEAJ62 </url> after clicking on the link, click on Sign in with Google button at the bottom of the window, choose your GV Google email from the list of google accounts that you have.
</p>
